{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "7425f975-b08e-83da-82c0-86afd7c50dcf",
  "created_at": "2025-12-08T10:06:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Manuel Resendes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sandra Pimentel",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:01:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Sandra. Good morning, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:01:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, morning. I'm calling about a dog. A neighbor's dog, it keeps getting loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:01:49-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh no, okay. Let me get some details from you. Is the dog out right now, or is this something that's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:01:58-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Been happening. Three, four times now. It's out again this morning, actually. [pause] Sorry, I'm in the driveway and the signal here is, um, not great."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:02:08-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's all right, I can hear you okay. Just tell me if I cut out on you. What kind of dog is it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:02:17-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Big one. Brown, kind of a shepherd mix, I'd say. Not that I'm an expert. It's not mean, exactly. It just runs down the middle of the street. And with the leftover mess from the storm, the, uh, the nor'easter Friday into Saturday, there's branches and slush everywhere. Somebody's going to clip it with a car. Or it clips somebody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a worry, especially with the roads still messy from the weekend. Do you know if it's got a collar, a tag?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Red collar. Didn't see a tag. I didn't get close enough to check. [line breaks up] ...the kids on the block walk past there to the bus."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm sorry, you broke up there for a second. You said the kids walk past?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:07-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the kids walk right past that yard to get to the bus stop. So. I'd like somebody to look at it before it turns into something."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:18-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. And what's the address where the dog lives, or where it's been getting out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:24-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm at 7 Gidley Street. Fifth Ward. The dog's a couple doors up, but it ends up in front of my place most of the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Seven Gidley, got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:38-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Manuel Resendes. R-E-S-E-N-D-E-S."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you, Mr. Resendes. Is this the first time you've called about it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "For me, yeah. My wife usually makes these calls. She's the one who knows who to talk to. But she's traveling, so you got me. I'm not as good at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:03:58-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're doing just fine. She'd be proud."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:04:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "She'd have a list by now. Dates and times. I've got, uh, the general impression of a dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:04:10-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works too. So I'll take down what you've told me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can I ask who actually responds to this? Is that you folks, or the police, or somebody else? I wasn't sure who to call, honestly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 25,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Loose dogs go to animal control, and that's run through the police department side of things. I can send this over to them and note it as a repeat issue with a loose dog near seven Gidley. If the dog is out right now and you feel it's a danger, you'd want to call the police non-emergency line and they can send someone out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:04:50-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's out now, but it's not, you know, chasing anybody. It's just standing there looking at my truck."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:04:58-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so not an emergency, but worth a visit. Would you like me to give you a call back once it's logged, or do you just want it passed along?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A call back would be fine. It's 401-555-0161."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero-one-six-one, repeating that back, 401-555-0161. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. [line breaks up] If I miss it, leave a message. I'll be out and about, the signal's bad half the places I go."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:28-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Will do. And I'll put in that it's brown, shepherd mix, red collar, keeps getting out near your street, and that kids walk by to the bus. That last part should get their attention."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good. I'd rather not find out the hard way that it bites."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody wants that. I can't tell you exactly when an officer will get out there, but I'll make sure it's flagged today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:55-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. That's all I can ask. Thanks, Sandra."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:05:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Mr. Resendes. Stay warm out there, and tell your wife she's got a good stand-in."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-08T10:06:06-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll pass it along. She'll want a report. Bye now."
    }
  ],
